/109243","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109243","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109243.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109243.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-25T17:19:53Z"},"body":"Significantly improves #105957, although I'm not sure if it's fast enough to be considered fixed or not.\r\n\r\nLooking at the flamegraph, there were two major sections that seemed like low hanging fruit. \r\n\r\nThe first was that if `navigation_enabled` is `false`, then any update will cause every cell to clear its navigation, which isn't needed if navigation wasn't already in use.\r\n\r\nThe second was a bunch of overhead from the red black tree used to sort quadrants. I tried out `LocalVector` and `SortArray` instead to see how it would compare, and it's uglier but significantly faster.\r\n\r\n#### Numbers\r\nWith no optimizations, I get ~260 ms Physics spikes.\r\n<img width=\"392\" height=\"226\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97b691b5-b1bc-4ba5-82a3-fae7cf9de96a\" />\r\n\r\nWith the first optimization, I get 42 ms Physics spikes.\r\n<img width=\"512\" height=\"240\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/745b3516-2e7c-4be4-bbe3-22a73eb60892\" />\r\n\r\nWith both optimizations, I get 28 ms Physics spikes.\r\n<img width=\"525\" height=\"281\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b30610b-73ab-4be8-a50a-46955129fd72\" />\r\n\r\nAt that point, the process time dominates.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"h